#. "L_AME_010"
msgid "0230 Hours  15 AUG 2023\n"
msgstr "２０２３年８月１５日　経過時間０２：３０\n"

#. "L_AME_011"
msgid "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\n"

#. "L_AME_012"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries'\n"

#. "L_AME_013"
msgid "Necklace\n"
msgstr "ネックレス\n"

#. "L_AME_014"
msgid "De Vries' necklace\n"
msgstr "ネックレス\n"

#. "L_AME_015"
msgid "Picked up De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "カサンドラのネックレスを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AME_016"
msgid "Disable internal security hub\n"
msgstr "防犯カメラ管理装置を不能に\n"

#. "L_AME_017"
msgid "Obtain keycode necklace\n"
msgstr "ネックレス・キーを入手せよ\n"

#. "L_AME_018"
msgid "Download project files\n"
msgstr "重役のファイルを電送せよ\n"

#. "L_AME_019"
msgid "Disable external comms hub\n"
msgstr "緊急通報システムを不能に\n"

#. "L_AME_020"
msgid "Gain entrance to laboratory\n"
msgstr "地下へのエレベーターに乗れ\n"

#. "L_AME_021"
msgid "Who are you and what are you doing here?\n"
msgstr "あなたは誰？　一体ここで何をしているの？\n"

#. "L_AME_022"
msgid "Look out! She's got a gun.\n"
msgstr "キャー！　この娘、銃を持ってるわ！\n"

#. "L_AME_023"
msgid "You won't shoot me, foolish child!\n"
msgstr "こんな小娘が、私を撃てるわけがないわ。\n"

#. "L_AME_024"
msgid "Don't you know who I am?\n"
msgstr "私を一体誰だと思っているの？\n"

#. "L_AME_025"
msgid "Let's see how you deal with security.\n"
msgstr "フン、このビルの警備をナメるんじゃないわよ。\n"

#. "L_AME_026"
msgid "PLEASE!!!!  Don't kill me!\n"
msgstr "おねがい、助けて！！\n"

#. "L_AME_027"
msgid "If I were you, I'd leave... NOW!\n"
msgstr "私があなたの立場なら、すぐここを去るわね！\n"

#. "L_AME_028"
msgid "Badly placed ECM Mine.\n"
msgstr "ＥＣＭマインが正しくセットされていません\n"

#. "L_AME_029"
msgid "ECM Mine placed correctly.\n"
msgstr "ＥＣＭマインが正しくセットされた\n"

#. "L_AME_030"
msgid "MISSION FAILED - objectives incomplete.\n"
msgstr "任務失敗\n"

#. "L_AME_031"
msgid "       MISSION SUCCESSFUL      \n"
msgstr "　　　任務完了　　　\n"

#. "L_AME_032"
msgid "CANNOT complete all objectives.\n"
msgstr "全ての任務を完了することができません\n"

#. "L_AME_033"
msgid "Time to erase those files.\n"
msgstr "このファイルを消し去るときがきたな\n"

#. "L_AME_034"
msgid "Computer executive erased.\n"
msgstr "重役が倒された\n"

#. "L_AME_035"
msgid "I'll do what you want!\n"
msgstr "言われた通り、何でもするよ！\n"

#. "L_AME_036"
msgid "HELP - Intruder!\n"
msgstr "助けてくれ、侵入者だ！\n"

#. "L_AME_037"
msgid "You talk too much.\n"
msgstr "しゃべりすぎだ。\n"

#. "L_AME_038"
msgid "HELP, HELP!\n"
msgstr "助けて、助けて！\n"

#. "L_AME_039"
msgid "I'll do what you want...\n"
msgstr "言われた通り、何でもするよ！\n"

#. "L_AME_040"
msgid "Logging on now...\n"
msgstr "さぁ、ログインして…\n"

#. "L_AME_041"
msgid "Okay, I'm in...\n"
msgstr "ＯＫ、パスワードを入力した…\n"

#. "L_AME_042"
msgid "Goodbye, Dr. Caroll.\n"
msgstr "グッバイ、ドクター・キャロル！\n"

#. "L_AME_043"
msgid "You've written your last bug, traitor!\n"
msgstr "これが最後のバグだな、裏切り者め！\n"

#. "L_AME_044"
msgid "File download initiated.\n"
msgstr "ファイルへのアクセス成功／電送開始\n"

#. "L_AME_045"
msgid "File download completed.\n"
msgstr "ファイルの電送完了\n"

#. "L_AME_046"
msgid "ACCESS DENIED - password needed.\n"
msgstr "アクセス拒否　パスワードが必要\n"

#. "L_AME_047"
msgid "Door unlocked.\n"
msgstr "ドアロック解除\n"

#. "L_AME_048"
msgid "DOH!\n"
msgstr "ＤＯＨ！\n"

#. "L_AME_049"
msgid "Unable to download - Data Uplink needed.\n"
msgstr "データリンカが必要です\n"

#. "L_AME_050"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW ON\n"
msgstr "照明ＯＮ\n"

#. "L_AME_051"
msgid "LIGHTS NOW OFF\n"
msgstr "照明ＯＦＦ\n"

#. "L_AME_052"
msgid "Erase Dr. Caroll conversation...\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロルの会話を消去するんだ…\n"

#. "L_AME_053"
msgid "Don't shoot, don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "撃たないで、撃たないで！\n"

#. "L_AME_054"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. "L_AME_055"
msgid "Unacceptable civilian casualties.\n"
msgstr "民間人が倒された\n"

#. "L_AME_056"
msgid ""
"MISSION FAILED \n"
" - objectives cannot be completed.\n"
msgstr ""
"任務失敗\n"
"　任務を完了できません\n"

#. "L_AME_057"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な人物が倒された\n"

#. "L_AME_058"
msgid "Obtain ECM Mines.\n"
msgstr "Obtain ECM Mines.\n"

#. "L_AME_059"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\n"

#. "L_AME_060"
msgid "ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "ＥＣＭマイン\n"

#. "L_AME_061"
msgid "An ECM Mine\n"
msgstr "ＥＣＭマイン\n"

#. "L_AME_062"
msgid "Picked up an ECM Mine.\n"
msgstr "ＥＣＭマインを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AME_063"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"

#. "L_AME_064"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_AME_065"
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "データリンカ\n"

#. "L_AME_066"
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "データリンカ\n"

#. "L_AME_067"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "データリンカを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AME_068"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I agree. Personality is expendable\n"
" in this case.\n"
msgstr ""
"あぁ、そうだ。「人格」はこの際\n"
"ギセイにしてもかまわん。\n"

#. "L_AME_069"
msgid ""
"No, I can start the process from my office\n"
" terminal and delete the necessary files\n"
" at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"いや、私のオフィスの端末から\n"
"問題のファイルを消し去ろう。\n"

#. "L_AME_070"
msgid "I'll begin at once. Goodbye.\n"
msgstr "今すぐ始めるよ、グッドバイ。\n"

#. "L_AME_071"
msgid "Move it!\n"
msgstr "さっさと動いて！\n"

#. "L_AME_072"
msgid ""
"I've got a password problem, and you're \n"
"the man to help me with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"あなたのパスワードが必要なの。\n"
"協力してくれるわよね！\n"

#. "L_AME_073"
msgid "Don't shoot, don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "撃たないで、撃たないで！\n"

#. "L_AME_074"
msgid "Datalink broken - connection terminated.\n"
msgstr "コネクションエラー：接続が途切れました\n"

#. "L_AME_075"
msgid "Datalink error - incomplete file download.\n"
msgstr "コネクションエラー：最後まで電送できませんでした\n"

#. "L_AME_076"
msgid "Internal security system temporarily disabled.\n"
msgstr "ビル内の防犯カメラが一時的に不能となった\n"

#. "L_AME_077"
msgid "External communications hub disabled.\n"
msgstr "ビル外への緊急通報システムが不能になった\n"

#. "L_AME_078"
msgid "Laboratory lift located.\n"
msgstr "研究エリアへのエレベーターを発見\n"

#. "L_AME_079"
msgid "Security... Help me!\n"
msgstr "ガードマン！　助けてくれ！\n"

#. "L_AME_080"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable security hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"防犯カメラ管理装置を不能にするには\n"
"ＥＣＭマインが必要\n"

#. "L_AME_081"
msgid "ECM Mine needed to disable comms hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"緊急通報システムを不能にするには\n"
"ＥＣＭマインが必要です\n"

#. "L_AME_082"
msgid "Dummy\n"
msgstr "ダミー？\n"

#. "L_AME_083"
msgid "How dare you disturb me!\n"
msgstr "私に向かって何という態度なの！\n"

#. "L_AME_084"
msgid "You will regret this intrusion, girl!\n"
msgstr "今に後悔するよ…\n"

#. "L_AME_085"
msgid "If I were you, I'd leave...NOW!\n"
msgstr "私があなたの立場なら、すぐここを去るわね！\n"

#. "L_AME_086"
msgid "Please don't kill me!\n"
msgstr "どうか、助けて！\n"

#. "L_AME_087"
msgid "Don't shoot!\n"
msgstr "撃たないで！\n"

#. "L_AME_088"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Obtain CamSpy.\n"

#. "L_AME_089"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\n"

#. "L_AME_090"
msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\n"

#. "L_AME_091"
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\n"

#. "L_AME_092"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "カムスパイを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AME_093"
msgid ""
"We're getting a positive reading - \n"
"the internal comms hub is nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"スキャナーに反応あり\n"
"防犯カメラの集中管理装置は近いぞ\n"

#. "L_AME_094"
msgid ""
"You're on the same floor as \n"
"Cassandra's office.\n"
msgstr "カサンドラのオフィスはこのフロアーだ。\n"

#. "L_AME_095"
msgid ""
"The other hub has got to be in the \n"
"Security Room.\n"
msgstr "セキュリティ・ルームはこの近くね。\n"

#. "L_AME_096"
msgid ""
"The basement elevator must be around \n"
"there somewhere.\n"
msgstr "地下へのエレベーターはこの近くのはずだ\n"

#. "L_AME_097"
msgid "Security system is now back online.\n"
msgstr "防犯カメラ管理装置が回復した\n"

#. "L_AME_098"
msgid "You vandal, you've broken it!\n"
msgstr "コイツ、ぶっ壊しやがって！\n"

#. "L_AME_099"
msgid "2023 AD, 2214 Hours  Lucerne Tower - dataDyne HQ\n"
msgstr "ＡＤ２０２３年　経過時間２２１４、データダイン本社、ルサーン・タワー\n"

#. "L_AME_100"
msgid "Why the big hurry?\n"
msgstr "で、どうしてこんなに急ぎなの？\n"

#. "L_AME_101"
msgid ""
"If Dr. Caroll is not extracted tonight, \n"
"dataDyne will put him through mind \n"
"conditioning, and we'll lose our best \n"
"chance of finding out what dataDyne \n"
"are up to.\n"
msgstr ""
"今夜ドクター・キャロルは\n"
"マインドコントロールにかけられてしまう。\n"
"p早く助けないと、データダイン社の\n"
"計画を知るチャンスを失う。\n"

#. "L_AME_102"
msgid "Are they all expendable?\n"
msgstr "ふーん。で、全員撃ち倒してもいいの？\n"

#. "L_AME_103"
msgid ""
"Don't joke! You have to be careful, Joanna. \n"
"Code keys will only operate while the owner \n"
"is alive... If you kill them, the key is \n"
"useless. Armed guards are a different matter, \n"
"of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"非武装の人間を撃ってはならないという\n"
"我々のルールを忘れたのか？\n"
"p…もちろん武装兵に手加減はいらんぞ。\n"

#. "L_AME_104"
msgid "What's the target location?\n"
msgstr "ターゲットはどこにいるの？\n"

#. "L_AME_105"
msgid ""
"Work your way down the building to the ground \n"
"level. Dr. Caroll will be in a research lab \n"
"somewhere in the underground facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"まずはビルの１階まで下りるのだ。\n"
"pドクター・キャロルはビルの地下の\n"
"研究室にいるとのことだから。\n"

#. "L_AME_106"
msgid "How will I recognize him?\n"
msgstr "どうやって彼を見分ければいいのかしら？\n"

#. "L_AME_107"
msgid ""
"We don't have an image record, and we can't \n"
"find any official files. All we have is the \n"
"name. Good luck, Perfect Dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"社員リストには見当たらないし…\n"
"名前以外は何もわからんが、よろしく頼む。\n"

#. "L_AME_108"
msgid "Right, I'm in...\n"
msgstr "ＯＫ、エンターしたぞ…\n"

#. "L_AME_109"
msgid "I...I'm logging on now.\n"
msgstr "い、いまログインするよ…\n"
